            text: "+--------------+----------------------+--------------+\n| bigint_array | nested_numeric_array | 配列         |\n|--------------+----------------------+--------------|\n| {1,2,3}      | {{1,2},{3,4}}        | {å,魚,текст} |\n| {}           | <null>               | {<null>}     |\n+--------------+----------------------+--------------+\nSELECT 2",
            items: 7,
